# career.front with Regular opponents (215,89) and Realistic Landings (277,130) on the pilot-skill
# form, the setting the earned career flies (END scores 11/8 x 10/8: 296 for this sortie).
# The career route's front end (tools/routes/career_serge.input): Serge chosen from the roster
